      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "I'm not a VR-user (not yet at least), but I'm seriously looking into getting a NOLO VR motion tracker for my phone. The controllers for those look and work very similarly to the vive's, so I'm assuming they'll also have the same problems (I'm not sure about the quality of the trackpads though, but I'm assuming they're the same part as HTC uses). Also, what's a \"hand gesture override animation\"?",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
